    "## 2. مقدمه‌ای بر تبدیل هاف / Introduction to Hough Transform\n",
    "\n",
    "تبدیل هاف یک تکنیک برای تشخیص اشکال هندسی در تصاویر است.\n",
    "\n",
    "The Hough transform is a technique for detecting geometric shapes in images.\n",
    "\n",
    "### اصل کار / Working Principle\n",
    "\n",
    "- **فضای تصویر → فضای پارامتر / Image space → Parameter space**\n",
    "- برای خطوط: معادله قطبی $\\rho = x \\cos\\theta + y \\sin\\theta$\n",
    "- برای دایره‌ها: معادله $(x-a)^2 + (y-b)^2 = r^2$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. ایجاد تصویر نمونه با خطوط / Create Sample Image with Lines"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر با خطوط مختلف\n",
    "# Create image with different lines\n",
    "image_lines = np.zeros((500, 700), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# خطوط افقی / Horizontal lines\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (50, 100), (650, 100), 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (100, 250), (600, 250), 255, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# خطوط عمودی / Vertical lines\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (200, 50), (200, 450), 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (500, 80), (500, 420), 255, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# خطوط مورب / Diagonal lines\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (50, 350), (300, 450), 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (400, 350), (650, 450), 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.line(image_lines, (100, 50), (350, 200), 255, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن نویز خفیف\n",
    "# Add slight noise\n",
    "noise = np.random.normal(0, 10, image_lines.shape)\n",
    "noisy_lines = np.clip(image_lines.astype(np.float64) + noise, 0, 255).astype(np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# تشخیص لبه با کنی\n",
    "# Edge detection with Canny\n",
    "edges = cv2.Canny(noisy_lines, 50, 150)\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([image_lines, noisy_lines, edges],\n",
    "               ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal', 'با نویز\\nWith Noise', 'لبه‌ها\\nEdges'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"اندازه تصویر / Image size: {image_lines.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. تبدیل هاف استاندارد برای خطوط / Standard Hough Line Transform\n",
    "\n",
    "تابع `cv2.HoughLines()` خطوط را در فضای پارامتر $\\rho$ و $\\theta$ پیدا می‌کند.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `cv2.HoughLines()` function finds lines in $\\rho$ and $\\theta$ parameter space."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# اعمال تبدیل هاف\n",
    "# Apply Hough transform\n",
    "lines = cv2.HoughLines(edges, rho=1, theta=np.pi/180, threshold=100)\n",
    "\n",
    "# رسم خطوط\n",
    "# Draw lines\n",
    "image_hough = cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "if lines is not None:\n",
    "    print(f\"تعداد خطوط یافت شده / Lines found: {len(lines)}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for line in lines:\n",
    "        rho, theta = line[0]\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # محاسبه نقاط انتهایی خط\n",
    "        # Calculate line endpoints\n",
    "        a = np.cos(theta)\n",
    "        b = np.sin(theta)\n",
    "        x0 = a * rho\n",
    "        y0 = b * rho\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # نقاط دور از مرکز\n",
    "        # Points far from center\n",
    "        x1 = int(x0 + 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "        y1 = int(y0 + 1000 * (a))\n",
    "        x2 = int(x0 - 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "        y2 = int(y0 - 1000 * (a))\n",
    "        \n",
    "        cv2.line(image_hough, (x1, y1), (x2, y2), (0, 0, 255), 2)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"هیچ خطی یافت نشد / No lines found\")\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR), image_hough],\n",
    "               ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal', 'خطوط هاف\\nHough Lines'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ تبدیل هاف اعمال شد\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### تأثیر آستانه / Effect of Threshold"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# آزمایش آستانه‌های مختلف\n",
    "# Test different thresholds\n",
    "thresholds = [50, 100, 150, 200]\n",
    "results = []\n",
    "titles = ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal']\n",
    "\n",
    "for thresh in thresholds:\n",
    "    lines = cv2.HoughLines(edges, 1, np.pi/180, thresh)\n",
    "    img_result = cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    line_count = 0\n",
    "    if lines is not None:\n",
    "        line_count = len(lines)\n",
    "        for line in lines:\n",
    "            rho, theta = line[0]\n",
    "            a = np.cos(theta)\n",
    "            b = np.sin(theta)\n",
    "            x0 = a * rho\n",
    "            y0 = b * rho\n",
    "            x1 = int(x0 + 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "            y1 = int(y0 + 1000 * (a))\n",
    "            x2 = int(x0 - 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "            y2 = int(y0 - 1000 * (a))\n",
    "            cv2.line(img_result, (x1, y1), (x2, y2), (0, 0, 255), 2)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    results.append(img_result)\n",
    "    titles.append(f'آستانه={thresh}\\nThreshold={thresh}\\n({line_count} خط/lines)')\n",
    "\n",
    "all_images = [cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)] + results\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(15, 10))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, (img, title) in enumerate(zip(all_images, titles)):\n",
    "    axes[i].imshow(cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2RGB))\n",
    "    axes[i].set_title(title, fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    axes[i].axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[-1].remove()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ تأثیر آستانه نمایش داده شد\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. تبدیل هاف احتمالاتی / Probabilistic Hough Transform\n",
    "\n",
    "تابع `cv2.HoughLinesP()` سریع‌تر است و نقاط انتهایی خطوط را مستقیماً برمی‌گرداند.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `cv2.HoughLinesP()` function is faster and returns line endpoints directly."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# اعمال تبدیل هاف احتمالاتی\n",
    "# Apply probabilistic Hough transform\n",
    "lines_p = cv2.HoughLinesP(edges, \n",
    "                          rho=1, \n",
    "                          theta=np.pi/180, \n",
    "                          threshold=50,\n",
    "                          minLineLength=50,\n",
    "                          maxLineGap=10)\n",
    "\n",
    "# رسم خطوط\n",
    "# Draw lines\n",
    "image_hough_p = cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "if lines_p is not None:\n",
    "    print(f\"تعداد خطوط یافت شده / Lines found: {len(lines_p)}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for line in lines_p:\n",
    "        x1, y1, x2, y2 = line[0]\n",
    "        cv2.line(image_hough_p, (x1, y1), (x2, y2), (0, 255, 0), 2)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # رسم نقاط انتهایی\n",
    "        # Draw endpoints\n",
    "        cv2.circle(image_hough_p, (x1, y1), 5, (255, 0, 0), -1)\n",
    "        cv2.circle(image_hough_p, (x2, y2), 5, (0, 0, 255), -1)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"هیچ خطی یافت نشد / No lines found\")\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR), image_hough_p],\n",
    "               ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal', 'هاف احتمالاتی\\nProbabilistic Hough'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ تبدیل هاف احتمالاتی اعمال شد\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### مقایسه هاف استاندارد و احتمالاتی / Comparison of Standard and Probabilistic Hough"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import time\n",
    "\n",
    "# هاف استاندارد\n",
    "# Standard Hough\n",
    "start = time.time()\n",
    "lines_std = cv2.HoughLines(edges, 1, np.pi/180, 100)\n",
    "time_std = time.time() - start\n",
    "\n",
    "img_std = cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "if lines_std is not None:\n",
    "    for line in lines_std:\n",
    "        rho, theta = line[0]\n",
    "        a = np.cos(theta)\n",
    "        b = np.sin(theta)\n",
    "        x0 = a * rho\n",
    "        y0 = b * rho\n",
    "        x1 = int(x0 + 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "        y1 = int(y0 + 1000 * (a))\n",
    "        x2 = int(x0 - 1000 * (-b))\n",
    "        y2 = int(y0 - 1000 * (a))\n",
    "        cv2.line(img_std, (x1, y1), (x2, y2), (0, 0, 255), 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# هاف احتمالاتی\n",
    "# Probabilistic Hough\n",
    "start = time.time()\n",
    "lines_prob = cv2.HoughLinesP(edges, 1, np.pi/180, 50, minLineLength=50, maxLineGap=10)\n",
    "time_prob = time.time() - start\n",
    "\n",
    "img_prob = cv2.cvtColor(image_lines, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "if lines_prob is not None:\n",
    "    for line in lines_prob:\n",
    "        x1, y1, x2, y2 = line[0]\n",
    "        cv2.line(img_prob, (x1, y1), (x2, y2), (0, 255, 0), 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش مقایسه\n",
    "# Display comparison\n",
    "display_images([img_std, img_prob],\n",
    "               [f'استاندارد\\nStandard\\n{time_std*1000:.2f}ms',\n",
    "                f'احتمالاتی\\nProbabilistic\\n{time_prob*1000:.2f}ms'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nمقایسه / Comparison:\")\n",
    "print(f\"هاف استاندارد / Standard Hough:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  تعداد خطوط / Lines: {len(lines_std) if lines_std is not None else 0}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  زمان / Time: {time_std*1000:.2f} ms\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\nهاف احتمالاتی / Probabilistic Hough:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  تعداد خطوط / Lines: {len(lines_prob) if lines_prob is not None else 0}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  زمان / Time: {time_prob*1000:.2f} ms\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. تبدیل هاف برای دایره‌ها / Hough Circle Transform\n",
    "\n",
    "تابع `cv2.HoughCircles()` برای تشخیص دایره‌ها استفاده می‌شود.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `cv2.HoughCircles()` function is used to detect circles."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر با دایره‌ها\n",
    "# Create image with circles\n",
    "image_circles = np.zeros((500, 700), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن دایره‌های مختلف\n",
    "# Add different circles\n",
    "cv2.circle(image_circles, (150, 150), 60, 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image_circles, (350, 150), 80, 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image_circles, (550, 150), 50, 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image_circles, (200, 350), 70, 255, 3)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image_circles, (450, 350), 90, 255, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن نویز\n",
    "# Add noise\n",
    "noise = np.random.normal(0, 5, image_circles.shape)\n",
    "noisy_circles = np.clip(image_circles.astype(np.float64) + noise, 0, 255).astype(np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# محو برای کاهش نویز\n",
    "# Blur to reduce noise\n",
    "blurred_circles = cv2.GaussianBlur(noisy_circles, (5, 5), 0)\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([image_circles, noisy_circles, blurred_circles],\n",
    "               ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal', 'با نویز\\nWith Noise', 'محو شده\\nBlurred'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"اندازه تصویر / Image size: {image_circles.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# تشخیص دایره‌ها\n",
    "# Detect circles\n",
    "circles = cv2.HoughCircles(blurred_circles,\n",
    "                           cv2.HOUGH_GRADIENT,\n",
    "                           dp=1,\n",
    "                           minDist=100,\n",
    "                           param1=50,\n",
    "                           param2=30,\n",
    "                           minRadius=30,\n",
    "                           maxRadius=100)\n",
    "\n",
    "# رسم دایره‌ها\n",
    "# Draw circles\n",
    "image_detected = cv2.cvtColor(image_circles, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "if circles is not None:\n",
    "    circles = np.uint16(np.around(circles))\n",
    "    print(f\"تعداد دایره‌های یافت شده / Circles found: {len(circles[0])}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for i, circle in enumerate(circles[0]):\n",
    "        x, y, r = circle\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # رسم دایره خارجی\n",
    "        # Draw outer circle\n",
    "        cv2.circle(image_detected, (x, y), r, (0, 255, 0), 3)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # رسم مرکز\n",
    "        # Draw center\n",
    "        cv2.circle(image_detected, (x, y), 2, (0, 0, 255), 3)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # نوشتن شماره\n",
    "        # Write number\n",
    "        cv2.putText(image_detected, str(i+1), (x-10, y-r-10),\n",
    "                    cv2.FONT_HERSHEY_SIMPLEX, 0.8, (255, 0, 0), 2)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        print(f\"دایره {i+1}: مرکز=({x}, {y}), شعاع={r}\")\n",
    "        print(f\"Circle {i+1}: center=({x}, {y}), radius={r}\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"هیچ دایره‌ای یافت نشد / No circles found\")\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([cv2.cvtColor(image_circles, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR), image_detected],\n",
    "               ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal', 'دایره‌های تشخیص داده شده\\nDetected Circles'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n✓ تشخیص دایره انجام شد\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### تأثیر پارامترها / Effect of Parameters"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# آزمایش پارامترهای مختلف\n",
    "# Test different parameters\n",
    "param_sets = [\n",
    "    {'param1': 50, 'param2': 20, 'minDist': 50},\n",
    "    {'param1': 50, 'param2': 30, 'minDist': 100},\n",
    "    {'param1': 100, 'param2': 30, 'minDist': 100},\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "results = []\n",
    "titles = ['تصویر اصلی\\nOriginal']\n",
    "\n",
    "for params in param_sets:\n",
    "    circles = cv2.HoughCircles(blurred_circles,\n",
    "                               cv2.HOUGH_GRADIENT,\n",
    "                               dp=1,\n",
    "                               minDist=params['minDist'],\n",
    "                               param1=params['param1'],\n",
    "                               param2=params['param2'],\n",
    "                               minRadius=30,\n",
    "                               maxRadius=100)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    img_result = cv2.cvtColor(image_circles, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "    circle_count = 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if circles is not None:\n",
    "        circles = np.uint16(np.around(circles))\n",
    "        circle_count = len(circles[0])\n",
    "        \n",
    "        for circle in circles[0]:\n",
    "            x, y, r = circle\n",
    "            cv2.circle(img_result, (x, y), r, (0, 255, 0), 2)\n",
    "            cv2.circle(img_result, (x, y), 2, (0, 0, 255), 3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    results.append(img_result)\n",
    "    titles.append(f\"p1={params['param1']}, p2={params['param2']}\\n\"\n",
    "                  f\"dist={params['minDist']}\\n({circle_count} دایره/circles)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "all_images = [cv2.cvtColor(image_circles, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)] + results\n",
    "display_images(all_images, titles, rows=2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ تأثیر پارامترها نمایش داده شد\")"
